Subject: [PATCH 1341/3799] soh: rename func_80BA24F8 ->
 ObjWarp2block_FindPartner

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: scans the item-action actor list for the other Obj_Warp2block sharing this switch flag and adopts it as a child, swapping the pair immediately when the flag is already set; after 60 frames without a match it complains and kills the actor.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
